cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PDFluent
message: >-
  If you use PDFluent in work you publish, cite it with the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Innovation Trigger B.V.
    website: https://pdfluent.com
repository-code: https://github.com/pdfluent/pdfluent-sdk
url: https://pdfluent.com
abstract: >-
  A pure-Rust PDF SDK: rendering, text and data extraction, document
  manipulation, AcroForm and experimental XFA form handling, PAdES signatures,
  redaction, and PDF/A validation and conversion. Bindings for Python, Node.js,
  .NET, Java, C and WebAssembly.
keywords:
  - pdf
  - pdf-a
  - rust
  - document-processing
  - digital-signature
# The SPDX field takes one identifier and this project is offered under two:
# the AGPL is the default, and the commercial licence is what pdfluent.com sells.
# `license-url` points at the file that states both, so the metadata is not read
# as "AGPL only".
license: AGPL-3.0-only
license-url: https://github.com/pdfluent/pdfluent-sdk/blob/main/LICENSE
version: 1.0.0
